# TourPublished Telegram rollout plan (INT-002)

Closes operational gaps after [ADR-INT-001](../architecture/adr/ADR-INT-001-tour-published-telegram.mdoc) domain emit and Denali surface mapping. **No runtime alias** from `TourCreated` → `TourPublished`; rollout uses catalog + policy + intent migration (Stripe product / subscription model).

## Implementation status (2026-06-30)

| Layer | Status | Notes |
| ----- | ------ | ----- |
| **INT-002a** effective catalog | **Shipped** | API DTO + web event list + deprecated UX |
| **INT-002b** policy SQL + drift | **Shipped** | Migration `20260704100000_backfill_tour_published_event_policies` |
| **INT-002c** intent remap CLI | **Shipped** | `pnpm --filter @apps/api run integrations:remap-tour-published-exposure` |
| **INT-002d** specs L0–L3 | **Shipped** | L2 green with `DATABASE_URL` + Denali golden fixture |
| **Per-environment ops** | **Pending** | migrate deploy, remap `--apply`, flags, Telegram smoke on each target DB |

Optional **deferred:** per-tenant policy backfill CLI (`run-tour-published-policy-backfill.ts`) — SQL migration is the primary path; add CLI only if partial-restore repair is needed.

## Problem statement

| Gap | Symptom |
| --- | ------- |
| Persisted policies | DB rows still `TourCreated` → publish emits `TourPublished` but dispatcher skips connection |
| Read model split | API DTO / web merge / synthetic legacy hardcode different event lists |
| Exposure intents | `scope.eventType` / `profileId` still `TourCreated` → field overrides not applied on publish |
| Deploy order | API deployed before backfill → silent no Telegram |
| Verification | No drift detector; doc references missing spec paths |

## Architecture model (authority)

```text
Surface (product catalog)     → declared events + defaults (SSOT for “what exists”)
integration_event_policies    → tenant enablement (SSOT for “is it on”)
outbox TourPublished          → domain fact at publish
integration_delivery_jobs     → async delivery (idempotent on domainEventId)
exposure_intents              → field/template overrides per route
```

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  subgraph done [INT-001 — shipped]
    E[atomic-canonical-tour-persist]
    S[denali-integration.surface TourPublished]
    D[resolveIntegrationDispatchPayload]
  end

  subgraph p1 [INT-002a — Effective catalog]
    C[resolveEffectiveIntegrationEventCatalog]
    W[web buildExposureEventTypeList SSOT]
  end

  subgraph p2 [INT-002b — Policy migration]
