  end

  done --> p1 --> p2 --> p2c --> p3
```

## PR train (merge order)

| PR | ID | Scope | Risk |
| -- | -- | ----- | ---- |
| 1 | **INT-002a** | Effective event catalog (API + web read model) | Low — read-only |
| 2 | **INT-002b** | SQL policy backfill + health drift detector (warn default) | Low — additive SQL |
| 3 | **INT-002c** | Exposure intent remap CLI (`--dry-run` / `--apply`) | Medium — data transform |
| 4 | **INT-002d** | Integration specs L0–L3 + operator runbook + optional fatal gate | Low |

Do **not** merge INT-002b/c before INT-002a (operators need truthful UI during migration).

