## INT-002a — Effective integration event catalog

### Goal

Single read-model helper for “what events does this connection expose in admin UI and DTOs?”

### New module

`apps/api/src/integrations/platform/resolve-effective-integration-event-catalog.ts`

**Input:**

- `workspaceType`, `providerId`
- `persistedPolicies[]` (from DB)
- `persistedIntents[]` (optional — for deprecated detection)

**Output per event:**

| Field | Meaning |
| ----- | ------- |
| `eventType` | e.g. `TourPublished` |
| `declaredOnSurface` | in `defaultEventPolicies` |
| `enabled` | persisted policy if row exists, else surface default |
| `deprecated` | `true` for superseded types (denali telegram `TourCreated`) |
| `supersededBy` | `TourPublished` when deprecated |
| `routingActive` | `integrationMappingsForEvent` non-empty today |

**Deprecated rule (v1):**

```text
deprecated := eventType === "TourCreated"
  && workspaceType === "denali"
  && providerId === "telegram"
  && surface no longer maps TourCreated
```

### Wire-up

| Consumer | Change |
| -------- | ------ |
| `integrations.service.ts` `toPublicDto` | `eventPolicies` from effective catalog (not raw DB only) |
| `integrations.service.ts` legacy synthetic mapper | remove hardcoded `[{ TourCreated }]` |
| `apps/web/.../build-exposure-event-type-list.ts` | primary list = surface declared events; skip deprecated policies **and** legacy intents |
| `integration-event-delivery-policy-panel.tsx` | deprecated migration callout when policy `deprecated: true` |
| `IntegrationConnectionLoadWarningsBanner` | `TOUR_PUBLISHED_POLICY_DRIFT` banner on Integrations + Exposure settings |

### DTO extension (backward compatible)

Add optional on public policy entries:

```typescript
readonly deprecated?: boolean;
readonly supersededBy?: string;
```

Web ignores unknown fields until wired.

### Tests

| Spec | Assert |
| ---- | ------ |
| `resolve-effective-integration-event-catalog.spec.ts` | denali telegram: TourPublished enabled by default; TourCreated deprecated |
| `apps/web/test/build-exposure-event-type-list.spec.ts` | `TourPublished` not `TourCreated` fallback |
| `integrations-verification.spec.ts` | legacy synthetic lists TourPublished |

### Acceptance

- Admin UI event tabs match surface catalog for new connections.
- Old DB-only `TourCreated` row visible as deprecated, not as active delivery route.

